38397>>>                Case Break
38398>>>
38398>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38398>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38398>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
38398>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38399>>>
38399>>>        Case End
